===Format===
* '''Group Stage:'''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** Rounds 2 to 5 are seeded using the {{Abbr|Buchholz system|Ranking based on opponents' performance}} & teams' initial seeds
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** Top 8 teams proceed to Playoffs
** {{Swiss Explained/VRS}}

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

